<title>SINGAPORE: Cerebos first half net profit flat.</title>
<headline>Cerebos first half net profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  47.01    vs   47.20</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     15.00    vs   15.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		   338.10    vs  346.86</p>
<p>    Other income		 3.52    vs    2.69</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  79.70    vs   78.04</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   0.27    vs    0.28</p>
<p>    Pretax			72.27    vs   72.25</p>
<p>    Associates		   0.86    vs    0.58</p>
<p>    Tax			   21.99    vs   20.72</p>
<p>    Minorities		  (4.14)   vs   (4.92)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    1.72    vs    1.16</p>
<p>Note - Food-based Cerebos Pacific Ltd said sales were lower for the first half due to the declining growth of Asian economies, tight credit conditions in China and also the termination of a distribution agreement for a product line in Australia.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
